{
  "$comment": "禁用词法源：docs/methodology/glossary.md（METH-002 §8）与 PRD-001 §1.3 废弃项表。改动本文件等于改产品红线，需要先改法源文档。",
  "terms": [
    {
      "term": "分镜",
      "en": "shot breakdown",
      "why": "与节拍板互斥；粒度小于 beat 的叙事单元在本产品中不存在",
      "use": "节拍板 BeatBoard / 节拍帧"
    },
    {
      "term": "故事板",
      "en": "storyboard",
      "why": "与节拍板互斥",
      "use": "节拍板 BeatBoard"
    },
    {
      "term": "单镜头时长",
      "en": "per-shot duration",
      "why": "组内时长微观分配归 AI，人只给板时长",
      "use": "板时长（≤ 30s）"
    },
    {
      "term": "单镜时长",
      "en": "per-shot duration",
      "why": "同上，METH-002 §8 的表述形式",
      "use": "板时长（≤ 30s）"
    }
  ],
  "include": ["apps", "docs", "scripts", "README.md", ".github"],
  "excludeDirs": ["node_modules", "dist", "coverage", ".git", ".vite"],
  "excludeFiles": ["scripts/forbidden-terms.json", "scripts/forbidden-terms.test.mjs"],
  "extensions": [
    ".ts",
    ".tsx",
    ".js",
    ".jsx",
    ".mjs",
    ".cjs",
    ".css",
    ".html",
    ".json",
    ".md",
    ".yml",
    ".yaml"
  ],
  "exceptions": [
    {
      "path": "docs/**",
      "reason": "方法论与 PRD 需要原文引用禁用词表本身；文档是法源，不是产品文案"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "reason": "红线说明需要点名禁用词"
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/web/src/App.test.tsx",
      "reason": "AC-6.8 守卫测试：必须写出禁用词才能断言全站 UI 文案不含它"
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/web/src/domain/prompt.test.ts",
      "reason": "AC-6.4 守卫测试：断言生成请求体里没有镜头级结构"
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/web/src/domain/locks.test.ts",
      "reason": "结构锁守卫测试：断言领域层不导出镜头级概念"
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/web/src/editor/BeatBoard.test.tsx",
      "reason": "AC-6.8 守卫测试：必须写出禁用词才能断言节拍板与宫格上找不到镜头级字段"
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/web/src/routes/ProjectsPage.test.tsx",
      "reason": "AC-6.1 / AC-6.8 守卫测试：断言新建表单里没有板数与镜头级结构选项"
    }
  ]
}
